# Written by hand: a response curl reads without complaint, as the standards
# allow (RFC 9110, 9112), though few servers write it so.
# A response to HEAD: its Content-Length is the GET's, and it has no body
# (RFC 9110, 9.3.2).
method HEAD
status HTTP/1.1 200
header Content-Type "application/json"
header Content-Length "4460"
framing empty
done keep
